xt-[var(--text-muted)]" aria-label="Chapter locked" title="Locked"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-lock w-3.5 h-3.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="18" height="11" x="3" y="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg></span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-3.5 sm:gap-4 px-2 sm:px-3 py-3.5 max-md:gap-2.5 max-md:px-0.5 max-md:py-2.5 min-h-[48px]"><span aria-hidden="true" class="w-7 h-7 sm:w-8 sm:h-8 max-md:w-6 max-md:h-6 rounded-full bg-[#b2b2b2] text-[var(--brand-primary-ink)] inline-flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-xs max-md:text-[11px] font-bold tabular-nums">40</span><span class="flex-1 min-w-0 text-sm sm:text-[15px] font-medium text-[var(--text-main)] leading-snug break-words">Chapter 40: Contemporary Yoga Institutions Ethics and Applications</span><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-[var(--text-muted)]" aria-label="Chapter locked" title="Locked"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-lock w-3.5 h-3.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="18" height="11" x="3" y="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg></span></li></ol></section><section aria-labelledby="book-description-heading" class="mt-8 max-md:mt-6"><h2 id="book-description-heading" class="text-lg max-md:text-base font-bold text-[var(--text-main)] mb-3 max-md:mb-2.5">About This Book &amp; Coverage</h2><div class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-main)]"><div class="markdown-body space-y-3"><p>Cracking the CUET PG Yoga examination (Paper Code COQP21) requires moving past surface-level asana knowledge into the rigorous philosophical, anatomical, and therapeutic doctrines demanded by the National Testing Agency (NTA). Designed explicitly for English-medium post-graduate aspirants, this text delivers an exhaustive synthesis of foundational scriptures, physiological mechanisms, and targeted chapterwise MCQs mapped precisely to the recent revision of the NTA syllabus.</p>
<p>Navigating the subtle conceptual traps of Indian philosophy determines the final cut-off percentile. Candidates routinely conflate the <em>Antahkarana Chatushtaya</em> with the <em>Chitta Vrittis</em>, or scramble the exact operational hierarchy of the <em>Pancha Koshas</em> as delineated in the <em>Taittiriya Upanishad</em>. Precision matters: distinguishing between <em>Samprajnata</em> and <em>Asamprajnata Samadhi</em>, or identifying the physiological contraindications of <em>Vamana Dhauti</em> versus <em>Vastra Dhauti</em>, separates top-tier ranks from the median pool.</p>
