<li>General category cut-offs consistently hover around 210-235 marks out of 300.</li>
<li>Scriptural mastery in <em>Sankhya Karika</em> and the four chapters of the <em>Yoga Sutras</em> accounts for nearly a third of all discriminant questions.</li>
<li>Accurate memorization of classical text verses yields immediate competitive advantage over generic preparation.</li>
</ul>
<p>Ground your preparation in authoritative secondary and primary traditions, including I.K. Taimni&#39;s <em>The Science of Yoga</em>, Swami Satyananda Saraswati&#39;s classical commentaries for the Bihar School of Yoga, and B.K.S. Iyengar&#39;s <em>Light on Yoga</em>. This dedicated study material synthesizes these masterworks to streamline your revision for absolute exam-day readiness.</p></div></div></section><div class="mt-7 pt-5 max-md:mt-5 max-md:pt-4 border-t border-[var(--border-subtle)]"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2.5 gap-y-1 text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)] tabular-nums"><span>Author:<!-- --> <strong class="font-semibold text-[var(--text-main)]">Mock Veda</strong></span><span aria-hidden="true">·</span><span>Published <!-- -->Nov 28, 2026</span><span aria-hidden="true">·</span><span>Updated <!-- -->Nov 28, 2026</span><span aria-hidden="true">·</span><a href="#write-review" class="font-medium text-[var(--text-main)] hover:underline underline-offset-4">Write the first review</a></div><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)]">Topics: <!-- -->CUET PG Yoga · Patanjali Yoga Sutras · Ashtanga Yoga · Chittavritti · Kriya Yoga · Previous Papers</p></div><section id="learner-reviews" aria-labelledby="learner-reviews-heading" class="mt-10 pt-8 max-md:mt-7 max-md:pt-6 border-t border-[var(--border-subtle)] scroll-mt-24"><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-end justify-between gap-4"><div><h2 id="learner-reviews-heading" class="text-lg font-bold text-[var(--text-main)]">Ratings &amp; Learner Reviews</h2><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)]">Authentic reviews from signed-in learners for <!-- -->CUET PG Yoga Exam Guide &amp; Structured Concept Notes PDF for Entrance Preparation<!-- -->.</p></div><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 min-h-[48px] px-4 rounded-lg border border-[var(--border-strong)] bg-[var(--bg-surface)] text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--text-main)] hover:bg-[var(--bg-ele